CITY OR THE CITIES WHOSE THE

00:08:58.204 --> 00:08:59.205
QUARTER OF CALIFORNIANS WHO LIVE

00:08:59.272 --> 00:09:00.473
IN THOSE COMMUNITIES WITH RENT

00:09:00.539 --> 00:09:03.542
CONTROL. SO OTHERWISE, IT SOUNDS

