BASICALLY ALLOWS LOCAL

00:35:42.073 --> 00:35:43.007
COMMUNITIES TO EXPAND RENT

00:35:43.074 --> 00:35:44.442
CONTROL AND REPEALS.

00:35:44.509 --> 00:35:45.009
COSTA-HAWKINS COSTA-HAWKINS

00:35:45.076 --> 00:35:47.879
PASSED IN 1995, AND THE

